  ⚠ Approve proposal p-0004 and apply these changes to /srv/new-example?                                                
                                                                                                                        
  Yes marks the proposal as approved and then makes the changes shown, the way adding the folder by hand makes them.    
  Right before that the proposal and its effect are read again, and nothing is applied if either differs from what you  
  saw. The result is kept on the proposal.                                                                              
    host: example.test                                                                                                  
    key type: ssh-ed25519                                                                                               
    fingerprint: SHA256:ExampleFingerprintForTestsOnly0000000000                                                        
    folder: /srv/new-example                                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
  Changes after yes                                                                                                     
    The folder is created with owner qhost-deploy:qhost-deploy and mode 0755.                                           
    The host key is stored and the repository is cloned into the folder.                                                
    No permission changes: the service can write already.                                                               
    The folder is added to the systemd drop-in of the service, which restarts once.                                     
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
